# 2026-07-26 (v0.9.0): witness efficiency — two maximal-Core-safe WIRE-FORMAT changes (no consensus logic).
# (1) Byte-pack raw_tx/prevouts via risc0 serde serialize_bytes (4 bytes/word) instead of one-word-per-byte
