# per input → witness 741000: 33.9MB→0.92MB (37x). Validated: regress + FULL adversarial suite (every hole
# REJECTS incl. #5 phantom-prevouts via the accumulator binding; honest accepted) + 130000/140000/741000
# VALID + all differential/negative tests. Only the witness encoding/structure changed → new id.
# Superseded id 7a8b29e0…
